   "subject": "font type and font size in plot",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>שלום,</div><div> </div><div>האם אפשר לשנות את גודל הפונט ואת סוג הפונט (לArial) בפקודה של plot עבור הטקסט ב</div><div>xlab, ylab, main ?</div><div> </div><div>האם יש אפשרות להגדיל את הפונטים בצירים עצמם ?</div><div> </div><div>תודה</div><div>נעה</div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "bYbXYNR8coEJ",
   "from": "Tal Galili",
   "author": "b24c10731fdfceaf",
   "date": "2013-02-04T18:49:15Z",
   "subject": "Re: [Israel RUG] font type and font size in plot",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">לשנות את הפונטים אני לא בטוח - צריך לבדוק.<div>לשנות גודל, תסתכלי ב:</div><div>?par</div><div><br></div><div>ספציפית:</div><div><dl><dt style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:medium;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n\r\n<code>cex</code></dt><dd style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:medium;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><p>A numerical value giving the amount by which plotting text and symbols should be magnified relative to the default. This starts as <code>1</code> when a device is opened, and is reset when the layout is changed, e.g. by setting <code>mfrow</code>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Note that some graphics functions such as <code><a href=\"http://127.0.0.1:20322/library/graphics/help/plot.default\" style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://127.0.0.1:20322/library/graphics/help/plot.default&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792498458440000&amp;usg=AOvVaw13HGS7a2Igknp4kGgoJ8iH\">plot.default</a></code> have an <em>argument</em> of this name which <em>multiplies</em> this graphical parameter, and some functions such as<code><a href=\"http://127.0.0.1:20322/library/graphics/help/points\" style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://127.0.0.1:20322/library/graphics/help/points&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792498458440000&amp;usg=AOvVaw097_JI-LNLcjpzJtdDl6Tf\">points</a></code> and <code><a href=\"http://127.0.0.1:20322/library/graphics/help/text\" style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://127.0.0.1:20322/library/graphics/help/text&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792498458440000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2yDXdfChUkuDDmtnxGCvfI\">text</a></code> accept a vector of values which are recycled. Other uses will take just the first value if a vector of length greater than one is supplied.</p>\r\n\r\n</dd><dt style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:medium;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><code>cex.axis</code></dt><dd style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:medium;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n\r\n<p>The magnification to be used for axis annotation relative to the current setting of <code>cex</code>.</p></dd><dt style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:medium;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><code>cex.lab</code></dt>\r\n\r\n<dd style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:medium;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><p>The magnification to be used for x and y labels relative to the current setting of <code>cex</code>.</p></dd><dt style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:medium;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n\r\n<code>cex.main</code></dt><dd style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:medium;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><p>The magnification to be used for main titles relative to the current setting of <code>cex</code>.</p>\r\n\r\n</dd><dt style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:medium;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><code>cex.sub</code></dt><dd style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:medium;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n\r\n<p>The magnification to be used for sub-titles relative to the current setting of <code>cex</code>.</p></dd><dt style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:medium;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></dt></dl></div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br>----------------Contact Details:-------------------------------------------------------<br>Contact me: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Tal.G...@gmail.com</a> |  <br>\r\n\r\nRead me: <a href=\"http://www.talgalili.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.talgalili.com&amp;source=gmail&a