    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I actually think the solution lays elsewhere- </div><div>The font is not a graphical parameter but rather a device parameter.</div><div>I thus recommend reading the device documentation. In particular, for reports, presentations and the likes, try the &quot;family&quot; switch in postscript() command.</div>\r\n\r\n<div>For viewing purposes, try ?x11 for Linux (windows as well I think) or ?quartz for Mac. </div><div><br></div><div>Jonathan </div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\" dir=\"rtl\"></div></div>"
    ],
